---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="P4｜Technology">

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-inner">
    <div class="kicker">VOL.01 · P4 · TECHNOLOGY</div>
    <h1>從晶片走向系統</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">

  <article class="card reading">

    <span class="tag">TECHNOLOGY PATH</span>

    <h2>六個連續節點</h2>

    <div class="tech-flow">
      <span>AI Compute</span>
      <b>→</b>
      <span>Advanced Process</span>
      <b>→</b>
      <span>Advanced Packaging</span>
      <b>→</b>
      <span>Optical Interconnect</span>
      <b>→</b>
      <span>Thermal / Power</span>
      <b>→</b>
      <span>System</span>
    </div>

    <p>
      研究重點不是預測某項技術何時取代另一項技術，
      而是觀察技術何時由可能性進入驗證、導入與量產。
    </p>

  </article>

</section>

<section class="page-nav">
  <a href="/research/vol01/p3">← P3</a>
  <a href="/research/vol01">Vol.01 Index</a>
  <a href="/research/vol01/p5">P5 →</a>
</section>

<style>
  .tech-flow {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 28px 0;
  }

  .tech-flow span {
    padding: 9px 12px;
    border: 1px solid #354457;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #0b1119;
  }

  .tech-flow b {
    color: #7188a0;
  }
</style>

</BaseLayout>
